				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>The temperature setting of the seat changes according to the switch position.</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>To ventilate your seat cushion, press the switch.</p>
				<p>Each time you press the switch, the airflow will change as follows:</p>
				<p> <term>OFF</term> &gt; <term>High</term> &gt; <term>Medium</term> &gt; <term>Low</term> &gt; <term>OFF</term> </p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p>The seat warmer (with air ventilation) defaults to the <i>OFF</i> position whenever the <term translate="no">EV</term> button is turned on.</p>
		<note type="caution">
			<p importance="high">Seat damage</p>
			<p>When cleaning the seats, do not use an organic solvent such as paint thinner, benzene, alcohol and gasoline. Doing so may damage the air ventilation seat.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
</concept>